:: StoryData
{
  "ifid": "D674C58C-DEFA-4F70-B7A2-27742230C0FC",
  "format": "SugarCube",
  "format-version": "2.37.3",
  "start": "Start"
}

:: StoryScript [script]
(() => {
  function initializeVariables() {
    const defaults = {
      health: 7,
      hunger: 5,
      trustCats: 5,
      trustHumans: 2
    };

    Object.entries(defaults).forEach(([name, value]) => {
      if (typeof State.variables[name] !== 'number') {
        State.variables[name] = value;
      }
    });
  }

  initializeVariables();

  function updateMusicButton(audio) {
    const button = document.getElementById('music-toggle');
    if (!button) {
      return;
    }

    const isPlaying = !audio.paused;
    button.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(isPlaying));
    button.innerHTML = `<span aria-hidden="true">${isPlaying ? '♫' : '♪'}</span> MUSIC: ${isPlaying ? 'ON' : 'OFF'}`;
  }

  function updateStatusBars() {
    ['health', 'hunger', 'trustCats', 'trustHumans'].forEach((name) => {
      const value = Math.max(0, Math.min(10, Number(State.variables[name]) || 0));
      const valueElement = document.querySelector(`[data-status-value="${name}"]`);
      const fillElement = document.querySelector(`[data-status-fill="${name}"]`);

      if (valueElement) {
        valueElement.textContent = value;
      }
      if (fillElement) {
        fillElement.style.width = `${value * 10}%`;
      }
    });
  }

  function loadSceneMedia() {
    document.querySelectorAll('.scene-media[data-scene-file]').forEach((media) => {
      if (media.querySelector('img, video')) {
        return;
      }

      const file = media.dataset.sceneFile;
      const isVideo = file.toLowerCase().endsWith('.mp4');
      const element = document.createElement(isVideo ? 'video' : 'img');
      element.dataset.file = file;
      const sources = [`assets/${file}`, `../assets/${file}`];
      let sourceIndex = 0;

      media.classList.add('is-loading');
      element.src = sources[sourceIndex];

      if (isVideo) {
        element.autoplay = true;
        element.loop = true;
        element.muted = true;
        element.playsInline = true;
        element.preload = 'metadata';
      } else {
        element.alt = media.getAttribute('aria-label') || 'Scene';
      }

      element.onerror = () => {
        sourceIndex += 1;
        if (sourceIndex < sources.length) {
          element.src = sources[sourceIndex];
          if (isVideo) {
            element.load();
          }
        } else {
          media.classList.remove('is-loading');
          media.classList.add('has-error');
        }
      };
      element.onload = () => media.classList.remove('is-loading');
      if (isVideo) {
        element.addEventListener('loadeddata', () => media.classList.remove('is-loading'), { once: true });
      }
      media.appendChild(element);
    });
  }

  $(document).on(':passagerender', () => {
    const isAlleyEntry = State.passage === 'Beco';

    loadSceneMedia();

    if (isAlleyEntry) {
      window.setTimeout(() => {
        const media = document.querySelector('.scene-media');
        if (!media) {
          return;
        }
        media.classList.add('powering-on');
        window.setTimeout(() => media.classList.remove('powering-on'), 850);
      }, 0);
    }

    updateStatusBars();

    if (!document.querySelector('link[data-neko-favicon]')) {
      const favicon = document.createElement('link');
      favicon.rel = 'icon';
      favicon.type = 'image/svg+xml';
      favicon.href = `data:image/svg+xml,${encodeURIComponent(
        '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 32 32">' +
        '<rect width="32" height="32" rx="6" fill="#777b70"/>' +
        '<path d="M7 12 10 5l6 5 6-5 3 7v9c0 4-4 6-9 6s-9-2-9-6z" fill="#26352b"/>' +
        '<circle cx="13" cy="18" r="2" fill="#a0b17f"/>' +
        '<circle cx="21" cy="18" r="2" fill="#a0b17f"/>' +
        '</svg>'
      )}`;
      favicon.dataset.nekoFavicon = 'true';
      document.head.appendChild(favicon);
    }

    let audio = document.getElementById('background-music');
    if (!audio) {
      audio = document.createElement('audio');
      audio.id = 'background-music';
      audio.loop = true;
      audio.preload = 'none';
      audio.src = 'assets/background-music.mp3';
      audio.addEventListener('error', () => {
        if (audio.src.endsWith('/assets/background-music.mp3')) {
          audio.src = '../assets/background-music.mp3';
        }
      }, { once: true });
      document.body.appendChild(audio);
    }

    updateMusicButton(audio);
  });

  $(document).on(':passageend', updateStatusBars);

  const sceneObserver = new MutationObserver(loadSceneMedia);
  sceneObserver.observe(document.body, { childList: true, subtree: true });

  $(document).on('click', '#music-toggle', () => {
    const audio = document.getElementById('background-music');
    if (!audio) {
      return;
    }

    if (audio.paused) {
      audio.play().then(() => updateMusicButton(audio)).catch(() => updateMusicButton(audio));
    } else {
      audio.pause();
      updateMusicButton(audio);
    }
  });
})();

:: StoryStylesheet [stylesheet]
:root {
  --ink: #c5d0d5;
  --muted: #7a718a;
  --panel: rgba(17, 25, 41, 0.96);
  --blue: #6374a3;
  --blue-light: #a49bc4;
  --steel: #3d3951;
  --street: #0c1114;
  --gameboy-shell: #777b70;
  --gameboy-shell-dark: #4c514b;
  --gameboy-shell-red: #913b3b;
  --gameboy-screen: #a0b17f;
  --gameboy-ink: #26352b;
}

* {
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
  background:
    linear-gradient(rgba(126, 130, 163, 0.03) 1px, transparent 1px),
    radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0%, #28263c 0, #15111d 42%, #06060a 100%);
  background-size: 100% 5px, auto;
  color: var(--ink);
  font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, sans-serif;
  font-size: 16px;
  min-height: 100vh;
}

#story {
  max-width: 1200px;
  margin: 2rem auto;
  padding: 0 0.25rem 2rem;
}

.game-layout {
  align-items: start;
  display: grid;
  gap: 1rem;
  grid-template-columns: 270px minmax(0, 1fr);
}

.status-sidebar {
  position: sticky;
  top: 1rem;
}

#passages {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #929784, var(--gameboy-shell) 58%, #686e61);
  border: 3px solid var(--gameboy-shell-dark);
  border-radius: 1.25rem 1.25rem 2rem 1.25rem;
  box-shadow: 8px 10px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35), inset 0 0 0 2px rgba(219, 224, 194, 0.18);
  padding: clamp(1rem, 3vw, 2rem);
  position: relative;
}

.passage {
  color: var(--gameboy-ink);
  font-size: 1.1em;
  line-height: 1.45;
}

.scene-media {
  background: var(--gameboy-screen);
  border: 0.7rem solid #30372f;
  clear: both;
  border-radius: 0.3rem;
  display: block;
  box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 0.25rem #586c4d, 0 0.4rem 0 rgba(44, 49, 42, 0.7);
  height: clamp(240px, 38vw, 400px);
  margin: 0 auto 0.5rem;
  max-width: 92%;
  overflow: hidden;
  position: relative;
  visibility: visible;
  z-index: 1;
}

.scene-media.powering-on::after {
  background: #10150f;
  color: #b5c79b;
  content: 'POWER ON';
  display: grid;
  font: 0.8rem 'Courier New', monospace;
  inset: 0;
  letter-spacing: 0.2em;
  opacity: 0;
  place-items: center;
  pointer-events: none;
  position: absolute;
  z-index: 3;
  animation: gameboy-power-on 850ms steps(3, end) forwards;
}

.scene-media.powering-on {
  background: #10150f;
}

.scene-media.powering-on > * {
  visibility: hidden;
}

.scene-media.powering-on .scene-placeholder {
  visibility: visible;
}

@keyframes gameboy-power-on {
  0%, 35% {
    opacity: 1;
  }
  65% {
    opacity: 0.75;
  }
  100% {
    opacity: 0;
  }
}

.scene-media img {
  display: block;
  height: 100%;
  image-rendering: pixelated;
  object-fit: cover;
  width: 100%;
}

.scene-placeholder {
  background:
    linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0 35%, rgba(38, 53, 43, 0.18) 35% 65%, transparent 65%),
    var(--gameboy-screen);
  display: block;
  inset: 0;
  position: absolute;
  z-index: 0;
}

.scene-media img, .scene-media video {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
}

.scene-media video {
  display: block;
  height: 100%;
  object-fit: cover;
  width: 100%;
}

.scene-media.is-loading::after {
  color: var(--gameboy-ink);
  content: 'LOADING MEDIA...';
  font: 0.75rem 'Courier New', monospace;
  left: 50%;
  position: absolute;
  top: 50%;
  transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
}

.scene-media.has-error::after {
  color: var(--gameboy-ink);
  content: 'MEDIA UNAVAILABLE';
  font: 0.75rem 'Courier New', monospace;
  left: 50%;
  position: absolute;
  top: 50%;
  transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
}

.passage h1, .passage h2, .passage h3 {
  color: var(--gameboy-ink);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 0.8rem;
  justify-content: space-between;
  font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;
  font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 3vw, 1.8rem);
  font-weight: 500;
  line-height: 1.35;
  min-width: 0;
  overflow: visible;
  width: 100%;
}

.passage h1::before, .passage h2::before, .passage h3::before {
  color: var(--gameboy-shell-dark);
  content: '✚';
  flex: 0 0 1.5rem;
  font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
  font-size: 3em;
}

.passage h1::after, .passage h2::after, .passage h3::after {
  background:
    radial-gradient(circle, var(--gameboy-shell-red) 0 45%, transparent 48%) 2.35rem 0.1rem / 2rem 2rem no-repeat,
    radial-gradient(circle, var(--gameboy-shell-red) 0 45%, transparent 48%) 0rem 1.15rem / 2rem 2rem no-repeat;
  color: var(--gameboy-shell-dark) !important;
  content: '';
  display: inline-block;
  flex: 0 0 4.5rem;
  font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
  font-size: 7rem;
  height: 4rem;
  letter-spacing: 1rem;
  line-height: 2rem;
  min-width: 5rem;
  text-align: center;
  width: 5rem;
}

.scene-media + h1, .scene-media + h2, .scene-media + h3 {
  margin-top: 0;
}

.passage ul {
  list-style: none;
  margin: 1.5rem 0 0;
  padding: 0;
}

.passage li {
  margin: 0.65rem 0;
}

a {
  background: #b5bad3;
  border: 2px solid var(--gameboy-shell-dark);
  border-radius: 0.3rem;
  box-shadow: 0 3px 0 var(--gameboy-shell-dark);
  color: var(--gameboy-ink) !important;
  display: block;
  padding: 0.7rem 0.9rem;
  text-decoration: none;
}

a:hover {
  background: #e2e5c7;
  color: #101c16 !important;
  transform: translateY(1px);
}

/* .passage blockquote {
  border-left: 3px solid var(--gameboy-shell-dark);
  color: #344836;
  padding-left: 1rem;
} */

.status-panel {
  color: var(--muted);
  display: grid;
  font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
  font-size: 0.7rem;
  gap: 0.75rem;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  width: 100%;
}

.status-item {
  align-items: center;
  display: flex;
  gap: 0.6rem;
  min-width: 0;
}

.status-content {
  flex: 1;
  min-width: 0;
}

.status-label {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
}

.status-icon {
  border: 1px solid var(--steel);
  color: var(--muted);
  display: inline-block;
  flex: 0 0 1.8rem;
  font-size: 0.45rem;
  height: 1.8rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  line-height: 1.8rem;
  text-align: center;
  width: 1.8rem;
}

.status-icon img {
  display: block;
  filter: invert(78%) sepia(10%) saturate(450%) hue-rotate(160deg);
  height: 1.2rem;
  margin: 0.25rem;
  width: 1.2rem;
}

.status-bar {
  background: var(--street);
  border: 1px solid var(--steel);
  display: block;
  height: 0.5rem;
  margin-top: 0.3rem;
  overflow: hidden;
  width: 100%;
}

.status-fill {
  background: var(--blue);
  display: block;
  height: 100%;
  transition: width 180ms ease;
  width: 0;
}

.status-panel b {
  color: var(--blue-light);
  font-size: 0.9rem;
}

.music-toggle {
  background: var(--street);
  border: 1px solid var(--steel);
  color: var(--blue-light);
  cursor: pointer;
  font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
  font-size: 0.7rem;
  margin-top: 1rem;
  padding: 0.7rem 0.8rem;
  transition: background 150ms ease, color 150ms ease, box-shadow 150ms ease;
  width: 100%;
}

.music-toggle:hover, .music-toggle[aria-pressed='true'] {
  background: #2f263e;
  box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(99, 103, 163, 0.25);
  color: #fff;
}

@media (max-width: 600px) {
  #story {
    margin: 0.75rem auto;
  }

  .game-layout {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }

  .status-sidebar {
    position: static;
  }

  #passages {
    padding: 1rem;
  }
}

:: Start
<figure class="scene-media scene-placeholder-only" aria-label="Game Boy screen"><span class="scene-placeholder" aria-hidden="true"></span></figure>
! Neko

//A game about the life of a stray cat.//

Millions of cats live on the streets worldwide. Most were born outside, or were abandoned by people who once called them pets. They are not wild, and they are not safe.

Life on the street is often short and always difficult:

* ''Hunger:'' Strays rely on scraps, rubbish and occasional kindness. Food is unreliable and often unsafe.
* ''Disease:'' Without vaccines or veterinary care, infections spread easily, especially in winter.
* ''Danger:'' Traffic, cruelty, poison, dogs and extreme weather are constant threats.
* ''Fast reproduction:'' One unsterilized female can have multiple litters a year, and many kittens do not survive. This is why sterilization programs are important.

In this game, you ''are'' one of them.

* [[Start in the alley|Beco]]

:: Beco
<<scene "alley.mp4" "A city alley">>
! The Alley

You wake up in a narrow alley, with the nasty smell of garbage filling your nose. The past nights were long and cold. Now, the city is waking up around you, but the streets are still quiet. Only the sound of rain dripping from the rooftops and the occasional car passing by can be heard.

You're an elegant, <<listbox "$gender" autoselect>><<option "female">><<option "male">><</listbox>> cat. You lick your <<listbox "$fur" autoselect>><<option "black">><<option "grey">><<option "orange">><<option "white">><</listbox>> fur clean, stretch and get up. You walk down the alley, and see your <<listbox "$eyes" autoselect>><<option "green">><<option "yellow">><<option "blue">><<option "gray">><</listbox>> eyes glowing, reflected in a puddle.

Your stomach growls, as you haven't eaten properly in two days. You must find food and water quickly. You also need to be careful, as the city is full of dangers, and not all humans are kind.

* [[Procurar comida|Parque]]
* [[Explorar a estação|estação de Comboios]]
* [[Explorar o restaurante|Restaurante]]

